zo yako mubashara kwenye tovuti hii.','The chat is switched off. Nothing is loaded on your site.'=>'Mazungumzo yamezimwa. Hakuna kilichopakiwa kwenye tovuti yako.','Chat key'=>'Ufunguo wa gumzo','Copy this from the Live chat page of your %s.'=>'Nakili hii kutoka kwenye ukurasa wa mazungumzo ya moja kwa moja wa %s yako.','Zinn Digital® dashboard'=>'Dashibodi ya Zinn Digital®','Show the chat'=>'Onyesha mazungumzo','Show the chat window to visitors of this site'=>'Onyesha dirisha la gumzo kwa wageni wa tovuti hii','Until you tick this, the plugin adds nothing at all to your pages — no script, no cookie, no requests.'=>'Hadi utakapoweka tiki hapa, programu-jalizi haiongezi chochote kwenye kurasa zako — hakuna hati, hakuna kuki, hakuna maombi.','%s — guides and services'=>'%s — miongozo na huduma','User guides'=>'Miongozo ya watumiaji','Read the %s user guide'=>'Soma mwongozo wa mtumiaji wa %s','Hide this'=>'Ficha hii','Zinn® hosting for WordPress'=>'Upangishaji wa Zinn® kwa ajili ya WordPress','LiteSpeed, daily backups, free migration and a control panel built for people who run more than one site.'=>'LiteSpeed, nakala rudufu za kila siku, uhamiaji wa bure na kidhibiti kilichoundwa kwa ajili ya watu wanaoendesha zaidi ya tovuti moja.','The Zinn® marketplace'=>'Soko la Zinn®','Buy and sell established sites, domains and link placements, with the money held safely until both sides are happy.'=>'Nunua na uuze tovuti, vikoa na nafasi za viungo zilizowekwa tayari, huku pesa zikiwekwa kwa usalama hadi pande zote mbili zitakapofurahi.','Zinn Hub® — hire people who do this for a living'=>'Zinn Hub® — ajiri wataalamu wanaofanya hili kwa kazi yao','Our global freelance marketplace: browse over 10,000 ready-made services from writers, designers, developers and SEOs, or post a project and let them bid.'=>'Soko letu la kimataifa la wanafanyakazi huru: vinjari huduma zaidi ya 10,000 zilizotayari kutoka kwa waandishi, wabunifu, wasanidi programu na wataalamu wa SEO, au chapisha mradi 